<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>What It's REALLY Like to Have a Filipina Wife - 30 Chapter Special</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-newspaper: #f8f5eb;
      --bg-paper-texture: #f3eedd;
      --ink-black: #111111;
      --ink-charcoal: #2a2a2a;
      --ink-pencil: #8c857b;
      --accent-red: #b8281d;
      --speech-bg: #ffffff;
      --card-radius: 12px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
      user-select: none;
    }

    body, html {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      background-color: #1a1816;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .desktop-container {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      max-width: 480px;
      max-height: 900px;
      background-color: var(--bg-newspaper);
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(var(--bg-paper-texture) 15%, transparent 16%),
        radial-gradient(var(--bg-paper-texture) 15%, transparent 16%);
      background-size: 60px 60px;
      background-position: 0 0, 30px 30px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      border-radius: var(--card-radius);
      border: 3px solid var(--ink-black);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    @media (min-width: 500px) {
      .desktop-container {
        height: 92vh;
      }
    }

    .newspaper-header {
      padding: 10px 16px 8px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink-black);
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(248, 245, 235, 0.95);
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .masthead-sub {
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: var(--ink-pencil);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink-black);
      padding-bottom: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .masthead-title {
      font-family: 'Impact', 'Georgia', serif;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      color: var(--ink-black);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    /* Voice Panel */
    .voice-settings-btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 8px;
      right: 12px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--ink-black);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 1px 1px 0px var(--ink-black);
    }

    .voice-panel {
      display: none;
      position: absolute;
      top: 40px;
      left: 12px;
      right: 12px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-black);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 10px;
      z-index: 40;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px var(--ink-black);
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
    }

    .voice-panel.open { display: block; }

    .voice-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .voice-name {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: var(--accent-red);
      max-width: 180px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .test-voice-btn {
      background: var(--bg-newspaper);
      border: 1px solid var(--ink-black);
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .comic-deck {
      flex: 1;
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      touch-action: pan-y;
    }

    .comic-card {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.35s ease-out, opacity 0.35s ease-out;
      padding: 10px;
    }

    .comic-card.active {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
      transform: translateX(0);
    }

    .comic-panel-frame {
      flex: 1;
      border: 3px solid var(--ink-black);
      background-color: #fff;
      background-image: linear-gradient(0deg, var(--bg-newspaper) 0%, #ffffff 100%);
      border-radius: 6px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    }

    .svg-canvas-container {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      position: relative;
    }

    svg.comic-svg {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    .draw-path {
      stroke: var(--ink-black);
      stroke-width: 2.2;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
      fill: none;
    }

    .pencil-path {
      stroke: var(--ink-pencil);
      stroke-width: 0.9;
      stroke-dasharray: 3 3;
      fill: none;
      opacity: 0.4;
    }

    .shading-path {
      stroke: var(--ink-charcoal);
      stroke-width: 1;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      fill: none;
    }

    .accent-path {
      stroke: var(--accent-red);
      stroke-width: 2.2;
      fill: none;
    }

    .speech-bubble {
      position: absolute;
      background: var(--speech-bg);
      border: 2.5px solid var(--ink-black);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      max-width: 82%;
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: var(--ink-black);
      line-height: 1.25;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px var(--ink-black);
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(0.85);
      transition: opacity 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275), transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
      z-index: 20;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .speech-bubble.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1);
    }

    .speech-bubble::after, .speech-bubble::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      border-style: solid;
      display: block;
      width: 0;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .speech-bubble.tail-bottom-left::after {
      bottom: -11px; left: 18px;
      border-width: 11px 9px 0 0;
      border-color: var(--speech-bg) transparent;
    }
    .speech-bubble.tail-bottom-left::before {
      bottom: -15px; left: 16px;
      border-width: 14px 11px 0 0;
      border-color: var(--ink-black) transparent;
    }

    .speech-bubble.tail-bottom-right::after {
      bottom: -11px; right: 18px;
      border-width: 11px 0 0 9px;
      border-color: var(--speech-bg) transparent;
    }
    .speech-bubble.tail-bottom-right::before {
      bottom: -15px; right: 16px;
      border-width: 14px 0 0 11px;
      border-color: var(--ink-black) transparent;
    }

    .speaker-name {
      font-size: 0.58rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: var(--accent-red);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      display: block;
    }

    .comic-caption {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 8px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: #fff;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-black);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--ink-black);
      z-index: 15;
      text-align: center;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .controls-footer {
      padding: 8px 12px 12px;
      background: var(--bg-newspaper);
      border-top: 2px solid var(--ink-black);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      z-index: 30;
    }

    .controls-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      background: #fff;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-black);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: var(--ink-black);
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--ink-black);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .nav-btn:active {
      transform: translate(2px, 2px);
      box-shadow: 0px 0px 0px var(--ink-black);
    }

    .nav-btn:disabled {
      opacity: 0.4;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      box-shadow: none;
      transform: none;
    }

    .icon-btn {
      width: 32px; height: 32px;
      padding: 0; border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .pagination-dots {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      max-width: 140px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding: 2px 0;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 6px; height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink-black);
      background: transparent;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .dot.active {
      background: var(--accent-red);
      transform: scale(1.3);
    }

    .card-counter {
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: var(--ink-black);
    }

    .audio-prompt-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background: rgba(248, 245, 235, 0.96);
      z-index: 50;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .audio-prompt-card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 3px solid var(--ink-black);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--ink-black);
      max-width: 320px;
    }

    .audio-prompt-title {
      font-family: 'Impact', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--ink-black);
    }

    .audio-prompt-desc {
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--ink-charcoal);
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .audio-start-btn {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px;
      background: var(--accent-red);
      color: #fff;
      border: 2px solid var(--ink-black);
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px var(--ink-black);
    }

    .swipe-hint {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 38px; right: 14px;
      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      color: var(--accent-red);
      font-weight: bold;
      animation: pulseSwipe 1.5s infinite alternate;
      z-index: 15;
      pointer-events: none;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--ink-black);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    @keyframes pulseSwipe {
      0% { transform: translateX(0); }
      100% { transform: translateX(-6px); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="desktop-container">
    <header class="newspaper-header">
      <div class="masthead-sub">
        <span>DAILY COMIC EDITION</span>
        <span>30-CHAPTER SPECIAL</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="masthead-title">What It's REALLY Like to Have a Filipina Wife</h1>
      <button class="voice-settings-btn" id="voicePanelToggle">⚙️ VOICES</button>

      <div class="voice-panel" id="voicePanel">
        <div class="voice-row">
          <span>Husband Voice:</span>
          <span class="voice-name" id="husbandVoiceLabel">Detecting...</span>
          <button class="test-voice-btn" id="testHusbandBtn">▶ TEST</button>
        </div>
        <div class="voice-row">
          <span>Wife Voice:</span>
          <span class="voice-name" id="wifeVoiceLabel">Detecting...</span>
          <button class="test-voice-btn" id="testWifeBtn">▶ TEST</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="comic-deck" id="comicDeck"></main>

    <div class="audio-prompt-overlay" id="audioOverlay">
      <div class="audio-prompt-card">
        <h2 class="audio-prompt-title">INTERACTIVE COMIC</h2>
        <p class="audio-prompt-desc">Tap below to enable Microsoft Andrew &amp; Jenny neural voice actors and live progressive drawing animations.</p>
        <button class="audio-start-btn" id="startAudioBtn">▶ START 30-CARD STORY</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="controls-footer">
      <div class="controls-row">
        <button class="nav-btn" id="prevBtn" disabled>◀ PREV</button>
        
        <div class="pagination-dots" id="dotsContainer"></div>

        <span class="card-counter" id="cardCounter">01 / 30</span>

        <button class="nav-btn" id="nextBtn">NEXT ▶</button>
      </div>

      <div class="controls-row" style="justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 2px;">
        <button class="nav-btn icon-btn" id="replayBtn" title="Replay Scene">↺</button>
        <button class="nav-btn icon-btn" id="muteBtn" title="Toggle Sound">🔊</button>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    /* ===================================================================
       FULL 30 CHAPTER STORYBOARD & DIALOGUES
